# Server Development Rules

## API Design
- Use RFC 7807 Problem Details for error responses
- All endpoints must be typed end-to-end
- Use dependency injection via typedi

## Error Handling
- Throw typed Problem subclasses, never plain Error
- Always handle async errors with try/catch
- Log errors with context (request ID, user ID)
